  "idea": "Automated meeting cost calculator that shows the dollar value of big syncs",
  "text": "This calendar plugin calculates the exact salary cost of every scheduled call before you hit send. Remote teams suffer from meeting creep because scheduling a calendar invite feels completely free. Packing schedules with ten-person syncs burns forty engineering hours each week on passive listening. Adding a Meeting Cost extension into Google Calendar flags high-dollar calls and suggests async Slack recaps. You reclaim thousands in wasted payroll every month.",
